rem Consecutive Positive Divisors
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=179
rem Count the integers 1 < n < Limit for
rem which n and n + 1 have the same
rem number of positive divisors

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Limit integer = 10000000

rem Divisors pair up as d and n / d, so
rem each d up to the root adds 2 to its
rem multiples above d^2 and 1 to d^2.
Cnt = array shape (Limit + 1) fill 0
Root = Limit isqrt
for D in 1 to Root
  Cnt (D * D) += 1
  Cnt (D * (D + 1) to Limit by D) += 2
end
Answer = (Cnt equal (Cnt -1 shift)) count
Answer print
